    {
      "text": "Completion criteria for each TB preventive treatment regimen (6H, 3HR, 3HP, 1HP, 4R): total duration in months, expected number of doses, the number of doses that makes up 80% of recommended doses, and the extended time allowed for completion (duration plus 33%).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
